    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331530/extras/be32ffee2166c5ce01b831ab0219b8eb.poster.avif?t=1752790567\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331530/extras/be32ffee2166c5ce01b831ab0219b8eb.webm?t=1752790567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331530/extras/be32ffee2166c5ce01b831ab0219b8eb.mp4?t=1752790567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Set sail and embark on a thrilling adventure on a mysterious pirate island. Dive deep into an open world survival craft game where danger and wonder await at every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331530/extras/8a4de09384988f64e710cf15f73ddde8.avif?t=1752790567\" /></span>Navigate through treacherous waters, explore hidden coves, and uncover the secrets of the island. Every inch of the pirate island is filled with tales waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival and Crafting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salvage materials from shipwrecks, gather resources, and craft essential tools and weapons. Building your own pirate haven is crucial for survival against the elements and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331530/extras/7c631aa1e947e894a4c8940cb5a98a37.avif?t=1752790567\" /></span>The surrounding waters are teeming with exotic sea creatures. Cast your line and fish for sustenance, or dive beneath the waves to encounter the mysteries of the deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331530/extras/2f364f9907e092d005625cf881e55dfa.avif?t=1752790567\" /></span>Brew potions and rum, not just for for celebration! Brew potent concoctions to keep your spirits high. But remember, moderation is key in these treacherous times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware, for the island isn't just about survival and treasure. It holds secrets as deep and vast as the ocean itself. Are you brave enough to uncover them?</p>",
